                       "description":  "Developers use this page to review all image template matching attempts that occurred during a workflow run. Each entry represents a moment where the automation engine tried to locate a visual element on screen using image recognition. The user needs to see the full list of attempts, understand which succeeded and which failed, and view the confidence scores to assess matching reliability. This is the primary diagnostic tool for tuning image-based automation.",
