                       "description":  "The core value of this page is visual debugging. When image recognition fails or produces unexpected results, the developer needs to see the actual screenshot with annotations showing where the template was matched (or where the system looked). Annotated screenshots with bounding boxes over the detected region are the single most useful debugging artifact for image-based automation.",
